Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}おいおい、待てよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What was the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}質問なんだっけ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You had a good question
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I want to answer, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}いい質問だったから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}答えたいんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, we were just talking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}about that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}いや、さっきまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}when you showed the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}porn to the executives,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}重役にポルノを見せた話をしてて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and now we're talking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}about your sneaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今はあんたのスニーカーの話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah. At Adidas, at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今のAdidasなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I should be the person that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}says, Nori, get a sneaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「Nori、お前のスニーカー作れ」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺が言える立場のはずなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's right. I should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the person that delegates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そう　俺が采配を振るう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}立場のはずなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But instead, they gave it to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Stella McCartney's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}なのにその役は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Stella McCartneyの旦那に　回された
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:21.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And I'm not going to speak no ill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:21.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}on Stella McCartney's husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:21.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Stella McCartneyの旦那を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because I'm cool with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}uh, with his father-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}悪く言うつもりはないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あいつの義父とは仲がいいからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, that's my man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺の仲間なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That man stood next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}あの人は俺の隣に立ってくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We went into the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}We did all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}一緒にスタジオに入って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}一日中やったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We did 'Only One.' We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}did 'FourFiveSeconds.'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}『Only One』も　『FourFiveSeconds』も
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}一緒に作った
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, me and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Paul McCartney got joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺とPaul McCartneyは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}曲を一緒にやってるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}わかるだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So that's the reason why, Adidas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だからAdidasは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}you really found you a Virgil in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Stella McCartney's husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Stella McCartneyの旦那に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}自分たちのVirgilを見つけたわけだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and a person that I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to give a hug no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺が何があってもハグする相手をな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So because that's the way it is. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}like, even at war, even in John Wick,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そういうもんなんだよ　戦争でも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}John WickでもNeoでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}even with Neo, it's ones that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}they just have to pass on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}見逃さなきゃいけない相手がいる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So it's just like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Stella McCartney's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Stella McCartneyの旦那もそう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because he's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Stella McCartney's husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Stella McCartneyの旦那だから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}part of the reason why he became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Stella McCartney's husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それもあの人と結婚した
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}理由の一つなんだろうけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}he get a pass from Ye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}And you get a pass from Ye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Yeからは見逃してもらえる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}お前も見逃してもらえる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You get a pass from
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the culture, right?
